# Companypush auth (gofastapp-mvp / Prod)

Editorial sync from GoFastCompany uses **staff-attributed** Firebase sessions.

## Canonical pattern

Company verifies `company_staff`, then forwards:

- `Authorization: Bearer <staff Firebase ID token>`
- `x-gofast-staff-id: <company_staff.id>`

Reference: [`lib/training/training-engine-auth.ts`](lib/training/training-engine-auth.ts) (`assertStaffBearerAuth`).

## Athlete → Company reads

Forward Firebase Bearer + `x-athlete-id` (see Company `assertAthleteProxyAuth`).

## Do NOT

- Use internal key on staff/brand/athlete routes — machine lane only; see [cross-app-auth.mdc](cross-app-auth.mdc)
- Treat program owner or club leader Firebase as the Company companypush write actor

## Cron exception

Company cron jobs hit Prod without a staff session — secured by `CRON_SECRET` on the **Company** cron route, not by internal API key.
